      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After a bit of testing I think I've figured out that my issue is specifically caused by the Collision Module on the child particle system. Toggling that off stops it from crashing in-editor. Will need to test in-game to see if that stops it crashing there too. I'm not sure if that's the same issue that OP is running into as I'm not seeing any collision modules enabled in the video that they posted.\n\nEdit: Unity 2022 is definitely not happy with the buffer particle system. Getting a lot of asserts and errors when firing the system",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
