  "details": "Create 3 particle systems, with one of them being a sub emitter to the other 2. (You do this by parenting the object, setting the sub emitter, then unparenting the sub emitter)\n\nLoading in or resetting the avatar will cause vrc to crash. It's possible this crash only occurs if both parent particle systems are triggered simultaneously on load in.",
